#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_c.html.heex:18
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_h.html.heex:39
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:22
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_l.html.heex:15
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:20
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_n.html.heex:18
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_o.html.heex:20
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_p.html.heex:18
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_s.html.heex:18
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_t.html.heex:18
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_v.html.heex:20
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The command changes the channel you are looking at. You do not type the channel name."
msgstr "命令更改您所看到的频道 。 您不输入频道名称 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The command works on the channel you are looking at. Everyone in the channel sees the mode changes."
msgstr "命令工作在您所看到的频道上。 频道中的每个人都看到模式的变化."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_k.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The key is one word. It must match exactly, so upper and lower case letters matter."
msgstr "关键是一个词。 它必须完全吻合,所以大写字母和小写字母很重要."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_nk.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The letter is an upper case K. The command changes the channel you are looking at. You do not type the channel name."
msgstr "这封信是大案K. 命令更改您所看到的频道 。 您不输入频道名称 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_r.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The letter is an upper case R. The command changes the channel you are looking at. You do not type the channel name."
msgstr "信为大案R. 命令更改您所看到的频道 。 您不输入频道名称 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_l.html.heex:33
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The limit must be a whole number greater than zero. If the number is not valid, the limit does not change."
msgstr "限制必须是大于零的整数. 数字无效的,限额不变."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_c.html.heex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The message is saved without its formatting. Turning the mode off later does not bring the colors back."
msgstr "信件没有格式化而保存 。 稍后关闭模式不会带回颜色 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:59
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The message is saved, so it stays after a restart."
msgstr "消息已被保存, 因此在重启后会保留 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_n.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The mode comes from classic IRC, where people outside a channel could send text into it. Set it when you want the channel modes to state clearly that only members may speak."
msgstr "该模式来自经典的IRC,在频道外的人可以将文本发送到其中. 当您希望频道模式明确声明只有成员才能发言时设置它 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_k.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The mode command changes the channel you are looking at. You do not type the channel name."
msgstr "模式命令改变您所看到的频道 。 您不输入频道名称 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_nk.html.heex:25
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The operators see nothing. The person who knocks gets an error that says knocking is disabled for the channel."
msgstr "操作员什么也看不见. 敲门的人得到一个错误 说敲门是禁用的频道。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_v.html.heex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The person must be in the channel. Otherwise the command fails with an error."
msgstr "这个人一定在频道里 否则命令会因错误而失败 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_q.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The person must be in the channel. The command changes the channel you are looking at."
msgstr "这个人一定在频道里 命令更改您所看到的频道 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:77
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The person who set the message is not shown it when they join."
msgstr "设定消息的人在加入时不会显示."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_h.html.heex:59
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The rank is not kept when the person leaves the channel. ChanServ access lists have no half-operator level, so give it again with the command when needed."
msgstr "The rank is not kept when the person leaves the channel. ChanServ access lists have no half-operator level, so give it again with the command when needed."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:30
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The server counts the joins made within the chosen number of seconds. When the count reaches the limit, the next person is refused and asked to try again shortly."
msgstr "服务器计算在所选秒数内完成的连接 。 当计数达到极限时,下一个人被拒绝,要求他很快再试一次."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:36
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The throttle applies to every person who joins, operators and owners included. Only bots are exempt."
msgstr "The throttle applies to every person who joins, operators and owners included. Only bots are exempt."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_t.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The topic is the line shown above the messages of a channel. Everyone who joins reads it first. Lock it when the topic carries rules, links or an announcement that should not be edited by any member."
msgstr "话题是频道信息上方显示的行. 凡参会者先诵. 当主题带有规则,链接或不应由任何成员编辑的公告时锁定."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_h.html.heex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "They cannot change a locked topic, invite people, set the welcome message or pin messages."
msgstr "他们不能改变一个锁定的话题,请人,设置欢迎信息或标注信息."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_r.html.heex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "To get in, register your nickname with NickServ, identify, and then join again."
msgstr "要进入,用 NickServ 注册您的昵称, 识别, 然后再次加入 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_k.html.heex:42
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "To remove the key, you do not need to type it again."
msgstr "要删除密钥, 您无需再次键入 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Transfer ownership when you hand a channel over to someone else, for example when you step back from running it. You keep operator status, so you can still help. If you only want to share control, give the other person owner status instead and stay an owner yourself."
msgstr "Transfer ownership when you hand a channel over to someone else, for example when you step back from running it. You keep operator status, so you can still help. If you only want to share control, give the other person owner status instead and stay an owner yourself."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_k.html.heex:6
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Use a key when you want to share access with a word instead of inviting each person. Anyone who knows the key can join. Anyone who does not know it is turned away."
msgstr "想要用单词分享访问权限时使用密钥, 而不是邀请每个人 。 任何知道钥匙的人都可以加入 凡不知者,皆弃之."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_l.html.heex:6
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Use a user limit to keep a room small. It helps when a channel is meant for a team, a class or a game group. It also slows down a crowd that arrives all at once."
msgstr "使用用户限制来保持一个小房间. 当一个频道被指给一个团队,一个班级或一个游戏组时,它会有所帮助. 也使一众一时赶到."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Use it against join floods, when many nicknames enter at once to spam or disrupt a channel. Normal visitors rarely notice it, because people usually arrive a few at a time."
msgstr "Use it against join floods, when many nicknames enter at once to spam or disrupt a channel. Normal visitors rarely notice it, because people usually arrive a few at a time."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Use it for a closed group, such as a team, a staff room or a private game table. Every new member needs an operator to say yes first."
msgstr "Use it for a closed group, such as a team, a staff room or a private game table. Every new member needs an operator to say yes first."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Use it for talks, interviews, question sessions and announcements. A few people speak and everyone else listens. It is also a quick way to calm a channel during a flood or a heated argument."
msgstr "Use it for talks, interviews, question sessions and announcements. A few people speak and everyone else listens. It is also a quick way to calm a channel during a flood or a heated argument."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Use it to greet newcomers with what they need to know: what the channel is about, its rules, or where to start. The topic stays visible to everyone all the time. The welcome message is a private note that each person reads once, as they arrive."
msgstr "Use it to greet newcomers with what they need to know: what the channel is about, its rules, or where to start. The topic stays visible to everyone all the time. The welcome message is a private note that each person reads once, as they arrive."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_r.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Use it to keep out guests and throwaway nicknames. A registered nickname is protected by a password, so the same name always belongs to the same person. This makes bans and access lists more reliable, and it slows down spam from new names."
msgstr "Use it to keep out guests and throwaway nicknames. A registered nickname is protected by a password, so the same name always belongs to the same person. This makes bans and access lists more reliable, and it slows down spam from new names."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_c.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Use it when colored or bold text makes a channel hard to read. It is also useful against people who abuse colors to draw attention. Every message then looks the same, as plain text."
msgstr "Use it when colored or bold text makes a channel hard to read. It is also useful against people who abuse colors to draw attention. Every message then looks the same, as plain text."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_p.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Use it when it is fine for people to know that a room exists, but its name and topic should not be advertised. If the channel should not appear in the list at all, use secret mode instead."
msgstr "当人们知道一个房间存在时使用它,但是它的名字和话题不应该被广告. 如果该频道根本不应在列表中出现,则使用秘密模式。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_s.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Use it when the existence of the channel itself should stay hidden. Only people who already know the exact name can find it. Combine it with invite-only mode or a key to also control who may enter."
msgstr "当频道本身的存在应当保持隐藏时使用. 只有已经知道确切名字的人才能找到它. 将其与只邀请模式或同时控制谁可以输入的密钥组合在一起 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_v.html.heex:46
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Voice given with this command lasts while the person stays in the channel. It is not kept when they leave."
msgstr "Voice given with this command lasts while the person stays in the channel. It is not kept when they leave."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_v.html.heex:34
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Voiced users are marked with a voice icon in the user list."
msgstr "语音用户在用户列表中标注有语音图标."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_o.html.heex:25
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What operators can do"
msgstr "操作员能做什么"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_p.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What others see"
msgstr "别人看到的"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_s.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What stays hidden"
msgstr "隐藏的东西"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_nk.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When %{mode} is set, every %{command} attempt is refused. This is useful for invite-only channels that do not want to receive join requests."
msgstr "当%{mode}设定时,每次%{command}尝试都会被拒绝. 这对不想要接收联合请求的只邀请频道有用 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When a channel is moderated, only owners, operators, half-operators and voiced users can send messages. Regular members can still read but not write."
msgstr "When a channel is moderated, only owners, operators, half-operators and voiced users can send messages. Regular members can still read but not write."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_s.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When someone looks up a member with whois or the hover card, the channel is left out unless the viewer is in it too."
msgstr "当有人用\"谁\"或\"徘徊卡\"来检查一个成员时,除非收视者也在其中,否则这个频道会被排除在外."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_r.html.heex:26
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When someone tries to join, the server checks whether they are identified with NickServ right now."
msgstr "当有人试图加入时,服务器会检查他们是否现在与NickServ识别."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_l.html.heex:39
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When the channel has as many members as the limit, the next person who tries to join is refused with a message that the channel is full."
msgstr "当频道拥有与限制一样多的成员时,下一位试图加入的人会以一个消息拒绝,即频道是满的."

